Package: herminR
Type: Package
Title: Maximal Possible Influence and Noise-Aware Factor Influence
    Heatmaps for Response Surface Models
Description: Computes, bounds, and visualizes the Maximal Possible
    Influence (MPI) metric of Otava and Mylona (2020)
    <doi:10.1002/qre.2697> from fitted second-order response surface
    models, with noise-aware, norm-generalized and feasibility-aware
    extensions.
Version: 0.5.1
